glish letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":213590,"global_rank":252418},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":213584,"global_rank":252425},{"name":"awcarlsson/vibing-nature-bot","owner":"awcarlsson","html_url":"https://github.com/awcarlsson/vibing-nature-bot","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A Twitter bot which generates clips of nature documentaries overlaid with music.","topics":[],"score":213583,"global_rank":252431},{"name":"Cindy1229/Pygame-PlaneWars","owner":"Cindy1229","html_url":"https://github.com/Cindy1229/Pygame-PlaneWars","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213583,"global_rank":252432},{"name":"bermed28/Python-Sudoku-Backtracker","owner":"bermed28","html_url":"https://github.com/bermed28/Python-Sudoku-Backtracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Small Sudoku Game that uses backtracking and recursion","topics":[],"score":213583,"global_rank":252435},{"name":"StreamOfRon/s3-thumbnailer","owner":"StreamOfRon","html_url":"https://github.com/StreamOfRon/s3-thumbnailer